------------------------------------------------------------------------------
THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL NOT COVERED BY THE ABOVE
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Underlying 16S rRNA sequences are public records retrieved from NCBI and are
not redistributed here in bulk; the accession manifest identifies every record
used. Model weights are not redistributed; checkpoints are identified by hash
or hub revision. Patched trust_remote_code files under
glm_prototype_bundle (1)/dnabert2_local/ and dnabert_s_local/ derive from the
DNABERT-2 and DNABERT-S repositories and remain under their original Apache-2.0
licence; modifications are documented in dnabert2_patched/README_PATCHES.md.
